{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "73255dcb35dc55490a406b5e9ad4ca960a6dd7e7a5cf659cab79d462abf2ecb2", "ja": "「ただ理由なくトガってるわけじゃないぜ……。\nそう、アタシのミシンは……疾風（かぜ）！」", "zh": "“我可不是毫无理由地锋芒毕露……  \n没错，我的缝纫机就是……疾风（风）！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "339a8469e71b8b423eaa4358aacece1a0d0214a71ef8e0df58129190b490ac11", "ja": "「どんな衣装も、秒で仕上げてみせる！\nなぜならアタシは、最強の事務員だからサ……フッ」", "zh": "「无论什么样的服装，我都能瞬间搞定！\n因为我可是……最强的事务员啊……呵」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4d4c9afabde90056b0ab9ccfc7911622e7cbd71a15ce03998868cfa78ebee502", "ja": "……。\nあの、青羽さん？", "zh": "……。\n那个，青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "79048f45d84d3ae2ec42ad766863567c126f9f391802ff6d52eef24420085be5", "ja": "はっ！？　{$P$}さん！\nお、お疲れさまです……えへへ。", "zh": "啊！？{$P$}先生！您、您辛苦了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "65a0763c29d6d96fc6d0f478f178c5cc20f154cc3c50ac970057b939b6193e87", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまです。よかった、いつもの青羽さんだ。\n急にグレちゃったのかと思いましたよ。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。太好了，还是平时的青羽小姐。\n我还以为您突然变坏了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "86dcedad2fea4948761fb0c65ce7c23afbcccad9481bb7b747b1486d959341e6", "ja": "ええと……ちょっと方向性を模索していたというか！\n強い美咲になっていただけで……。", "zh": "那个……我只是在摸索方向而已！\n只是变成了强势的美咲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "79addf2dde2bb549737d99091d0dd826654c2263eae105f734865f0ab8bd008a", "ja": "強い青羽さん……なるほど？", "zh": "坚强的青羽小姐……原来如此？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "971a68ca529e6b906ddbcf7534b46bae6e3d256b39312dc81cf6494ad9f9e87b", "ja": "そ、それより！　社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！\n多分、あのイベントのお話なんじゃないかなーって。", "zh": "那、那个先不说！社长找您呢！\n我想，大概是要谈那个活动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e8524da27563dd3d5d65c7a365f28f2465b1ec8f3331bdb11b1c8e00eb4d9100", "ja": "あ、そうでしたか！　じゃあ行ってきます！", "zh": "啊，是这样啊！那我先过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "96eba9880454ef9213110826db995943c3e967d95f5232ab80ac30a0827be945", "ja": "わっ、速い！　まるで疾風（かぜ）みたいに……！？\nい、行ってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "哇，好快！简直像疾风一样……！？\n路、路上小心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "abc1402a4e634172810057e2508ef128fa7b74cb91f20f36a3190411a07b7e09", "ja": "やあ君！　早かったじゃないか。\nよく来てくれたね。", "zh": "嗨！你来得真早啊。\n谢谢你能来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "993131e4f11a25ea92e53b11f596e5cc990d9b2d08b18701a1c2bca8dc015907", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "19558b62db5329ed0d86fef6f7f7f12ae66450b37f3f5328d084840e01a587ee", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です！\n気が逸ってしまって。それで、今日の話はやはり……？", "zh": "呼、呼……社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！\n我有些按捺不住了。所以，今天要说的果然是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "70d1bbcedc629b946e0361cc70edc0fd3383bb92b1663bdff7c645206da802da", "ja": "うむ！　おそらく、君の思っている通りだよ。\nだがその前に、まずは労わせてくれたまえ。", "zh": "嗯！恐怕正如你所想。不过在那之前，先让我好好慰劳你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "272ce70b212c79037cfca79b0fa0e47ada6ca2c6e739078c79afec6283339028", "ja": "前回の『EmotionLight』公演は、最高の\n盛り上がりを見せていたね。本当に、ご苦労さま！", "zh": "上次的『EmotionLight』演出，气氛真是热烈到了极点呢。真的，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d821fb7729049b8fa5110bc8a1444aa6e26692dd5b0ae210ebb3c938bdf0dc75", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　そう言って頂けるのは\n嬉しいですけど、全部アイドル達の力ですよ。", "zh": "谢谢社长！听到您这么说\n我很高兴，不过这全都是偶像们的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "18d7030f2fca5fc6560256421682e72c78213d306c5623dc0d4996b2451b5c77", "ja": "もちろんそうだが、君の力によるところも大きい。\nもう少し自信を持ってもいいんじゃないかね？", "zh": "当然也是这样，但你的力量也起了很大的作用。\n你也可以再自信一点，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "36d651c6a97cc044f7d176514faab011f4dcd1465c4a5fbecccd7c97701f627a", "ja": "本当、謙虚な方ですよね。私はもっと、アピールして\n頂いても構わないんですけど……なんて♪", "zh": "您真的很谦虚呢。其实再多表现一下自己也没关系……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "07a7595a33c00f646a2f48a419600b597eefdb3de691b22e4c568df00d170e5f", "ja": "そんな、恐縮です！", "zh": "哪里哪里，您太客气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "7f7e576066147cd36abb32e39719b2ccd1bc2662c90262095665b689a27f39d2", "ja": "いやいや、それだけ自負を持って、\n仕事に当たって欲しい、という意味でもあるのだよ。", "zh": "不不，这也是希望你能带着相应的自信，\n去对待工作的意思哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "8d58ea420e4b5d8150ac01bc0e93fe6f80c686fc42efb99e1af9a3dad0a57983", "ja": "長かった『ミリオンシアターシーズン・ファイナル』\nも、残すところあとひとつ！", "zh": "漫长的《百万剧场季·最终季》也只剩下最后一项了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "1a4372f8d1cc1b90d3d112a5f8b5d2d6fb94aa778c933dca77960add1464432c", "ja": "有終の美を飾るのは、\nスペードとダイヤの混合チーム……。", "zh": "为这场完美收官画上句点的，\n是黑桃与方块的混合队伍……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "ee5564efe8b458b10427039d975f75bb135e72db162c167ab98bf367cc3875aa", "ja": "題して『FantasticLight』公演！\n喜び弾ける夜の祝祭だ！", "zh": "题为《FantasticLight》的公演！\n这是让喜悦迸发的夜之庆典！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "da147b24ede451d26f214f4b00c29f852ea9e90e055b9ff86ab7c146944c34dc", "ja": "やっぱり夜って、テンション上がりますもんね！\nそれに、なんだかロマンチックですし。", "zh": "夜晚果然就是会让人情绪高涨呢！\n而且，总觉得还挺浪漫的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "54046c3a58b8b01435cd913e8bd29c1ca7af862dc6a482b2f36ea6770e2d63ff", "ja": "朝、昼、夕と受け継がれてきた思いをまとめて、\n今こそ、ツアーのグランドフィナーレを飾るのだ！", "zh": "将清晨、正午、黄昏一路传承下来的心意汇聚于此，\n此刻，正是为巡演画上盛大终章的时刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "541b85545e5f62151835b6dafc042ae2431097dfb561f31e4fd5c625a2041b61", "ja": "そして、その勢いを衰えさせることなく、\n武道館へと繋げていってほしい。頼めるかね？", "zh": "然后，希望能让这股势头持续下去，一路延续到武道馆。能拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "53b4bce492e94c4a802ff2f5372be27365d77e6001da4f984f42d58144c268a9", "ja": "はい！　任せてください。\nアイドルのみんなと、最高潮に盛り上げてみせます！", "zh": "是！交给我吧。\n我会和偶像们一起，把气氛推向最高潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "83f62260f1d53c61037262aec0ecce251b2f960c0b1aadb02c5c0ecce79174b0", "ja": "（武道館は目の前だ。\nこのツアー、悔いのないようにやりきろう！）", "zh": "（武道馆就在眼前。\n这次巡演一定要全力以赴，不留遗憾地完成它！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
